{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23366","headline":"耳顺吟寄敦诗梦得 · 白居易","name":"耳顺吟寄敦诗梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十四十五慾牵，七十八十百病缠。\n五十六十却不恶，恬淡清净心安然。\n已过爱贪声利後，犹在病羸昏耄前。\n未无筋力寻山水，尚有心情听管弦。\n闲开新酒尝数醆，醉忆旧诗吟一篇。\n敦诗梦得且相劝，不用嫌他耳顺年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}